{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "9d23f92e16512b00c747fe04e5e134a769dc15cb0a58a32358918e787f87e448", "ja": "アイル", "zh": "アイル", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e2e22e90857458d75c5ff7852bf834c2e48c36bfc4e347e31665f913874a830f", "ja": "定期公演会、当日。静香や美希が見守る中、\nジュリアが登場。できたばかりの新曲を\n披露すると告げると、ボーカルを翼に託す。\n瑞希とジュリア、二人のコーラスを受け、\n翼は観客達を魅了していく。", "zh": "定期公演会当天。在静香和美希的注视下，  \n茱莉亚登场了。宣布要演唱刚刚完成的新曲后，  \n便将主唱交给了翼。  \n在瑞希和茱莉亚两人的和声伴唱下，  \n翼逐渐征服了观众们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c5c235b65d1d7c644c1a5f634354e967ccf73982351b7a76ea0327d879ad9632", "ja": "―定期公演会　当日―", "zh": "——定期演出会 当天——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "928f55a65df57c8c8ca09033890a7bbed4f60ea2290053afd68f495a17b1ee82", "ja": "ワアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "683b03c9b1b52a21e99a16915fc6f45ae658682c2efdc638c01b3cf7e5934893", "ja": "静香、次誰の番？", "zh": "静香，接下来轮到谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "0ac6f576f026c0dc38051497c15d35eb54216b10b0be3c9dd708e83aced4795c", "ja": "次は……ジュリアさんの曲です。", "zh": "接下来是……茱莉亚先生的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "274565fc6d96ea501849f6d90b9e0c3726f65990210c182bfbd385c9d66ed676", "ja": "ムニャ……。翼がいるね。", "zh": "呼呼……翼在这里呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "4637228e6b643110eac09b023bdd95c6995f8b9616af641f5fac8d5cb64fbb09", "ja": "えっと、翼はコーラスですね。\n真壁さんと二人で。", "zh": "呃，翼负责合唱。\n和真壁小姐两个人一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "cbaf9d7b7a4add32b877b0bd3f66dcb1213673e02549cca21c89b4e44c928ab8", "ja": "……時間だな。", "zh": "……到时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "e745694e03e740554230dd24c74795f988cfebd78889a1dac97600850f609856", "ja": "今回はあたしのワガママに付き合ってくれて\n感謝してる。こんなに胸が高鳴るのは久しぶりだよ。", "zh": "这次愿意陪着我的任性胡闹，我很感谢你。像这样心潮澎湃，已经好久没有过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6a82c5c5145d7494ec8abd63258a934ec79de182274366be7c90cd1d9bb18be8", "ja": "わたしも出来るだけ、ジュリアーノに合わせて歌うね。", "zh": "我也会尽量跟着茱莉亚诺一起唱哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "4bb2516ad060f04a601a3e2ec17be8ee9d5ec157235f075628472a3ceb76c194", "ja": "バーカ。翼、オマエは自分の好きに歌え。\nあたしに合わせようなんて絶対考えるな。", "zh": "笨蛋。翼，你按自己喜欢的方式唱。\n绝对别想着配合我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "703302293796e588271e7f72dd8c25522d6a8f80b88b48fba5179a113836707c", "ja": "この曲の主役は翼だ、\nあたしがそうなるようにした。", "zh": "这首歌的主角是翼，这是我一手促成的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "f83e9be1a491593adabab6d3b6b81382e1df759072ac5cecb45e70ce1ea18620", "ja": "暴れて来い、\nあたしとミズキに背中を任せて前だけ見てろ。", "zh": "去尽情发挥吧，\n把后背交给我和水木，只管往前冲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "dfc4d050f329125079b764bb14f7feda990764b7beb3bda3e9dcedd830c1f164", "ja": "この曲が始まってから終わるまで、\nその間だけは、それがウチらのチームワークだ。", "zh": "从这首歌开始到结束，\n在这段时间里，那就是我们之间的团队默契。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1013_null", "source_sha256": "8bbbfbaf7ab971a79f835aa84c9938d1896f0fd674c36cbc80b92f968ee72515", "ja": "―定期公演会　前夜―", "zh": "—定期公演会 前夜—", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "20d7a0c891724da5269e50f262692848793ca4bb69bf30f7cf87143cff876329", "ja": "……新曲。\nそれを明日のライブで……ですか。", "zh": "……新歌。\n要在明天的演出中……表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "163dc33e0c5601cabe4c03522dbfd8b748b9687976df553cd3d81d1c3546cb86", "ja": "ああ。さっき翼と歌っててピンときてさ。\n急な話なのは分かってる。でも……。", "zh": "是啊。刚才和翼一起唱的时候，我突然有了灵感。\n我知道这事说得很突然。但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "603832a70e3a35612c31a128bc922c26dc253256e0ee7cfd9c6357e3d5e27489", "ja": "分かりました。\nいけると思います。私も歌います。", "zh": "明白了。\n我觉得可以。我也会唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "aeb054ac258c99fd6503ce661e687689c8d561962d9cdb273bf06a82c4dc4549", "ja": "？　何か？", "zh": "？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "e238bff4f988f287d49056909fa6a6ceb02331d3c483f4d8684fb1fe69ec9d15", "ja": "いや、もっと驚くかと思ったからさ。\n明日だぜ？　普通もう少し悩むだろ。", "zh": "没，我只是以为你会更吃惊一点。\n可是明天就到了啊？按常理总该再烦恼一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "469a49054abd31780800375ce8db50e32becf45715e314ddf25356221219f1f5", "ja": "……実を言うと。\nこう見えて、とても驚いています。……ドキドキ。", "zh": "……说实话。\n别看我这样，其实非常惊讶。……扑通扑通。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "ebb3dde57fe1f2d81ed80ae7bd956e5c3cf352d141998056998ed589eb7b09af", "ja": "ただ、こう見えて……\n勝負事は好きなのです。", "zh": "不过，别看我这样……\n我其实很喜欢比赛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "0f5dfaa51abf589cb98d92eff26148e267dfc3e22a7a2b8ea7554f35dbb35044", "ja": "あー……。今日これから歌う曲は、\n昨日出来たばかりの新曲だ。", "zh": "啊——……今天接下来要唱的歌，\n是昨天刚完成的新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "5bcb42fb0b1201d7fd817c0a7ec0e45ed5858bd113214ff9bd2ca3f4c9f6b5a2", "ja": "もともとは歌詞も曲名もない未完成の曲だった。\nそれが昨日……。", "zh": "这首歌原本是没有歌词也没有歌名的未完成曲。\n直到昨天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "ba7a3bc7b6913d5770fd9ad5f5a5da546bab9e52ea0d3823101b120467b0896a", "ja": "とある少女がこの曲にツバサを与えてくれたんだ。\nまあゴタクはいいから聴いてくれ。", "zh": "有个女孩为这首歌赋予了翅膀。\n好了，废话少说，听听吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "0da2c25bcb1de1008908a9da5ff672e7fc586ba2846127a122e8d0b0988e9c57", "ja": "それじゃあ、あとは頼むぜ。メインボーカル！", "zh": "那么，接下来就拜托你了。主唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ae26a9d9341958b1a578bd835ae72206519ea10131818e3e101764ee6efc641f", "ja": "翼がセンター？", "zh": "翼是C位？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "030f02bfeb28ae82ead93b5b957887937fbb1d15cb4513763d7dfb3e02815c14", "ja": "コーラスのはずじゃ……。", "zh": "明明应该是合唱才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "a30c16228eff70eae37dc5eaef13b16f75c7a92079a882d3f964baf9ed77b69b", "ja": "いくぜ、新曲……『アイル』。", "zh": "上吧，新歌……《绝境》（《I'll》）。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c579f0a0e43d58dd7cfdb404988f1f0ca6c9c526a564983f52c0db78073d7a4f", "ja": "う……っお。\n翼のやつ、本気出したらやるじゃん！", "zh": "呜……喔。\n翼这家伙，认真起来挺能干的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "84eba23f3feb0c82e81e3402f85e28e40d12681081bb87b60f0d13f34239ce67", "ja": "（いいぞ、翼！　もっと！　もっと高く飛べる！）", "zh": "（好样的，翼！再高一点！还能飞得更高！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "52397c2c75aaade078e2326ba8ee6a1a0505e442a3f0aabda273863c2faf0cba", "ja": "（もっとワガママに！　どこまでも自由に！\nあたしとミズキ、両翼を従えて……）", "zh": "（再任性一点！再自由一点，直到天涯海角！让翼和瑞希成为我的双翼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "fade9da316519120392262809f4c5c43d4f63c133da014f60d89a40b09ccce5f", "ja": "（世界中を魅了しろ！）", "zh": "（让全世界为之倾倒吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1035_003mik", "source_sha256": "0b0319afc482870e8b9e6a5a08796cd9328e89cd0774d2baa395cd6f5ee3e73d", "ja": "やっぱり、ミキの思ったとおり……。\n翼にミキのダンサーは似合わないの。", "zh": "果然，和美希想的一样……  \n翼不适合当美希的舞者。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_05_1036_audience", "source_sha256": "928f55a65df57c8c8ca09033890a7bbed4f60ea2290053afd68f495a17b1ee82", "ja": "ワアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
